      "body": "Hello,\r\nI contact you about Wordpress plugin. When I enable \"Disable OneSignal initialization\" in Advanced settings, it seems like it still initializes.\r\nFurthermore, when I add the script manually to my \"functions.php\" child. I get the following error when I check Chrome's Dev console :\r\n- windows.OneSignal already defined as 'object' (https://i.imgur.com/JHsl1cg.png)\r\n\r\nI guess it's because OneSignal is initialized twice because the wordpress plugin doesn't disable the initialization. Any idea ?",
